# 0.1 (`RULE-POSITION-ENUMERATION`): a typed-block opener's label is a positional string and
# takes RULE 2.1's mandatory quotes, exactly as node/group/external/plane
# already did. The rewrite ADDS the quotes its own pattern requires to be
# absent, so it is idempotent by construction.
figdown 0.1 bitfield
bitfield hdr Header numbering=msb0
field "Version" 4
field "IHL" 4
field "Payload" 24
